<title>ARGENTINA: Menem signs airport privatization decree.</title>
<headline>Menem signs airport privatization decree.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine President Carlos Menem on Monday signed a decree for the privatization of 36 airports, Cabinet Chief Jorge Rodriguez said.</p>
<p>Argentina will seek bids for a 30-year concession to operate the airports, which will be awarded in October, Rodriguez told reporters.</p>
<p>A recent judge's ruling temporarily suspending the privatization &quot;will in no way affect the process of privatization of the airports,&quot; Rodriguez said.</p>
<p>((--Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
